**Process Overview:** The protocol begins with a meticulous **joint inspection** of the vehicle’s critical stress points, including the suspension, chassis, and glass seals. Concurrently, high-density **edge padding** is applied to all protruding areas and delicate surfaces. This dual approach prevents micro-abrasions and structural fatigue before transit begins.

