### Card 2: Hydraulic Ramp Loading & 4-Wheel Locking
**Process Overview:** Vehicles are moved onto the transport carrier using a precision-controlled **hydraulic ramp loading** system. This minimizes manual handling, reducing the risk of accidental contact. Once positioned, the **4-wheel lock** mechanism is engaged, securing each tire individually against lateral and longitudinal movement during transit.

**Equipment Used:**

**Shree Ashirwad Guarantee:** The combination of automated loading and rigid wheel immobilization ensures zero shifting during transport. **Shree Ashirwad** prioritizes this mechanical stability to guarantee that every vehicle remains secure, delivering true **safety** and **damage-free transit** to our customers.

***

### Card 3: Continuous Monitoring & Zero-Scratch Assurance
**Process Overview:** Throughout the journey, the **zero-scratch safety protocol** is maintained through continuous monitoring of the vehicle’s position and the integrity of the **edge padding** and **4-wheel lock** systems. Any deviation is immediately addressed by our trained logistics team, ensuring the **joint inspection** standards are met even after the vehicle is unloaded.

**Equipment Used:**

**Shree Ashirwad Guarantee:** **Shree Ashirwad** guarantees **damage-free transit** by treating every stage of the journey as critical. Our end-to-end **safety** measures, from **hydraulic ramp loading** to final delivery, ensure that your vehicle experiences a **zero-scratch** journey, backed by our strict quality assurance standards.</div>
