<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transport from Chandigarh to Pune | Express Enclosed Carrier
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does it typically take to transport a car from Chandigarh to Pune?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The door‑to‑door car transport from Chandigarh to Pune usually takes 3 to 4 business days, depending on traffic density, weather conditions, and any scheduled toll checks along NH 19, NH 27 and NH 48. Shree Ashirwad provides a realistic ETA during the quote stage and updates you via live GPS tracking throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is included in the car transport service?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Every shipment is covered by a 100 percent declared‑value, IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance that protects against accidental damage, theft, or natural hazards. The policy is automatically applied to the vehicle value you declare, and a detailed insurance certificate is shared with you before loading, ensuring full peace of mind.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle in real time during the Chandigarh‑Pune move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. All Shree Ashirwad carrier trucks are equipped with satellite‑based GPS units that feed live location data to a secure client portal. Once your car is loaded, you receive a tracking link that shows the exact position, estimated arrival time, and any route deviations, keeping you fully informed.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents do I need to provide for RTO registration after the shift?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need the original registration certificate, a copy of the insurance policy, the e‑Way bill generated for the interstate movement, a signed loading inspection report, and a government‑issued address proof for the new location in Pune. Shree Ashirwad’s logistics team assists in preparing these documents to avoid any registration delays.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any hidden fees or extra charges for the Chandigarh to Pune car transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">No hidden fees are applied. The quoted amount includes base freight, fuel surcharge, insurance, loading and unloading, GPS tracking, and any mandatory tolls. Optional services such as premium polishing, door‑to‑door concierge pickup, or additional crating are clearly itemised, so you know exactly what you are paying for.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the hydraulic ramp loading safe for luxury or vintage cars?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. The hydraulic ramp is equipped with anti‑slip surfaces and low‑angle gradients to minimise stress on chassis and suspension. Our trained operators perform a joint inspection, secure the vehicle with a 4‑wheel lock, and add custom edge padding or wooden crates for delicate parts, ensuring a scratch‑free journey for high‑value cars.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad ensure zero scratches during transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The zero‑scratch guarantee is backed by a multi‑layer safety protocol: a joint pre‑load inspection, hydraulic ramp loading with soft‑rubber rollers, 4‑wheel lock for immobilisation, and high‑density foam edge padding around vulnerable zones. Every carrier is inspected daily, and any deviation triggers an immediate corrective action, backed by full insurance coverage.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
