ny hidden fees or extra charges for the Chandigarh to Pune car transport?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No hidden fees are applied. The quoted amount includes base freight, fuel surcharge, insurance, loading and unloading, GPS tracking, and any mandatory tolls. Optional services such as premium polishing, door‑to‑door concierge pickup, or additional crating are clearly itemised, so you know exactly what you are paying for."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is the hydraulic ramp loading safe for luxury or vintage cars?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Absolutely. The hydraulic ramp is equipped with anti‑slip surfaces and low‑angle gradients to minimise stress on chassis and suspension. Our trained operators perform a joint inspection, secure the vehicle with a 4‑wheel lock, and add custom edge padding or wooden crates for delicate parts, ensuring a scratch‑free journey for high‑value cars."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does Shree Ashirwad ensure zero scratches during transit?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The zero‑scratch guarantee is backed by a multi‑layer safety protocol: a joint pre‑load inspection, hydraulic ramp loading with soft‑rubber rollers, 4‑wheel lock for immobilisation, and high‑density foam edge padding around vulnerable zones. Every carrier is inspected daily, and any deviation triggers an immediate corrective action, backed by full insurance coverage."}}]}
